# Follow-up Tips

### ❌ Basic Answer
> I celebrate with my family.

### ✅ Band 8 Answer
> I usually celebrate my birthday with my family because I enjoy spending quality time with them. We often have dinner together, cut a cake, and chat for hours. I find these simple celebrations far more meaningful than throwing a big party.

---

### ❌ Basic Answer
> Gifts are important.

### ✅ Band 8 Answer
> I don't think the price of a gift is important. What truly matters is the thought and effort behind it. Even a small, thoughtful present can leave a lasting impression if it reflects the recipient's personality and interests.

