# Examiner's Advice

✅ Add a personal example whenever possible.

For example:

> Last year, I celebrated my birthday with my parents and a few close friends. Instead of having a big party, we had dinner together, which made the occasion much more memorable.

Personal experiences make your answers sound natural and authentic, helping you achieve a Band 7.5+ score.
